<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Vakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya kutumbula ya Pauli kwa Vakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Vakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Vako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya kutumbula ya Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vakolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ya kutumbula kwa Vakolinto yayandikwi na mtumi Pauli mu mwaka wa 55 peamali kuvelekewa Kilisitu (musula ya 1:1). Yeniyi ndi balua ya kutumbula pagati ya balua zivili zetivii nazu zeaziyandiki Pauli kwa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vevitama kumuji wa Kolinto. Yihotoleka kuvya ayandiki balua yeniyi lukumbi peatamili ku Efeso kwakona kuvagendelela vandu va ku Kolinto, mulugendu lwaki lwa kuhamba Makedonia (musula ya 16:5-9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua yeniyi ndi mayangula ga Pauli kwa malovi geagapokili kuhuma kwa vamsadika vangi va msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ndava ya mambu gahakau na kulekengana na mambu ga ukemi. Muji wa Kolinto wamanyiki neju mu mambu ga ukemi hati yakangisi lepi kulola kuvya vandu vevamsadiki Kilisitu vavi mukuhenga mambu ago. Mubalua iyi ya 1 Vakolinto mewa kuvi na (sula ya 13). Yeyimanyikana neju ya uganu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli akuvajambusa Vakolinto na akumsengusa Chapanga ndava yavi (musula ya 1:1-9).</para>
  <para style="io">Kavili idandaula ndava mambu geagapokili ndava ya kulekengana pagati ya msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vevitama ku Kolinto (musula za 1:10-4:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi ijova ndava ya mambu ga ugoni na mambu ga vamsadika kutakilana mumabanji ga mihalu (musula ya 5-6).</para>
  <para style="io">Neju ago Pauli ilagiza ndava ya mambu ga ndowa na luteta lwa vimong'omong'o na mngonganu wa kufugamila na njombi kuhuma kwa Mpungu Msopi na uyukisu (musula ya 7-15).</para>
  <para style="io">Mwishu Pauli imalakisila kulongelela mambu gaki mwene mambu gangi (musula ya 16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Nene Pauli nikemeliwi kuvya mtumi wa Kilisitu Yesu, kwa maganu ga Chapanga, na mlongo Sostene.<verse eid="1CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>Tikuvayandikila nyenye msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu mwemuvi Kolinto. Nyenye mukemeliwi kuvya vandu va Chapanga kwa kuwungana na Yesu Kilisitu, pamonga na vandu voha popoha pevakumuyupa BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu mweavi BAMBU witu na wavi mewawa.<verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Nikuvaganila uteke na ubwina wa Chapanga kuhuma kwa Chapanga Dadi witu na BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mota ya mukuwungana na Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Nikumsengusa Chapanga wangu magono goha ndava yinu, ndava ya mota ya Chapanga yaavapelili kwa njila ya Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Muni kwa kuwungana na Kilisitu mmemiswi muvindu vyoha. Mpewi luhala lwa kukokosa na kumanya. <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>Ujumbi wa Kilisitu uyimi chakukangamala mugati yinu, <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>hati nakupungukiwa na chipanji chochoa kuhuma kwa Mpungu Msopi pemwilindila kugubukuliwa kwa BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Mwene yati akuvakangamalisa mbaka pamwishu mulolekanayi mwangali kuhoka ligono leiwuya BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Chapanga ndi msadikika, avakemili muvyai pamonga na mwana waki Yesu Kilisitu BAMBU witu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpechenganu mumsambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Valongo vangu, nikuvayupa neju kwa liina la BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu, mvya pamonga mukila lijambu lemwijova, mkoto kukomana pagati yinu mvya liholo limonga na lijambu limonga. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Valongo vangu, mambu genigayuwini kuhuma kwa vandu va Kuloe, kuvya mwihutana pagati yinu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Nigana kujova cheniyuwini kuhuma kwinu, mmonga ijova, “Nene nikumlanda Pauli,” Yungi, “Nene nikumlanda Apolo,” Yungi, “Nene nikumlanda Kefa,” Na yungi ijova, “Nene nikumlanda Kilisitu.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Wu, Kilisitu agavanyiki? Wu, Pauli ndi mweavambiwi pamsalaba ndava yinu? Amala mwabatiziwi kwa liina la Pauli?<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Nikumsengusa Chapanga nabatizi lepi mundu hati mmonga winu ndi nga Kilisipo na Gayo. <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Hinu kawaka mweihotola kujova abatiziwi kwa liina langu. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Chakaka nabatizi kavili vandu pa lukolo lwa Stefani, nambu kawaka nimanyili lepi ngati nabatizi mundu yungi. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Kilisitu anitumi lepi kubatiza vandu, nambu anitumili kukokosa Lilovi la Bwina. Anitumili kukokosa changali kuhuvalila maholo ga vandu vangi, muni makakala ga lifwa cha Kilisitu pamsalaba chikoto kubadilishwa.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisitu ndi makakala na luhala lwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Kwa vala vevayagili ujumbi wa chifwa cha Kilisitu pamsalaba uyimu, nambu tete mwetivii munjila ya usangula, ujumbi wenuwo ndi makakala ga Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Yati nihalibisa luhala lwa vevavi na luhala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">na yati niyagisa umanya wa vevavi na luhala.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Avi koki mweavi na luhala? Avi koki mweasomili? Avi koki mweamanyili kudandaula mambu ga mulima? Wu, Chapanga ahengili lepi luhala lwa mulima uwu kuvya ndi uyimu?<verse eid="1CO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Chapanga igana kuvasangula vala vevakumsadiki kwa njila ya makokoselu gegilolekana kuvya mambu ga uyimu. Akitili chenichi ndava muni vandu vihotola lepi kummanya Chapanga kwa luhala lwavi vene. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Vayawudi vigana chinamtiti na Vagiliki vilonda luhala. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Nambu tete tikumkokosa Kilisitu mweavambiwi pamsalaba. Kwa Vayawudi lijambu lenili ndi unonopa, na kwa vandu vangali kuvya Vayawudi ndi uyimu, <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>nambu kwa vala na Chapanga, Vayawudi na vandu vanga Vayawudi, Kilisitu ndi Makakala ga Chapanga na luhala lwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Muni chechilolekana kuvya uyimu wa Chapanga ndi luhala kuliku luhala lwa vandu, na chechilolekana kuvya ungolongondi wa Chapanga, ndi chivii na makakala kuliku makakala ga vandu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Hinu valongo vangu muholalela chamwakemiliwi na Chapanga, lepi voha pagati yinu vevana luhala kulandana na maholo ga vandu, vamahele lepi pagati yinu vevivya na makakala, amala ukulu. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Chapanga ahagwili gala mulima ukugawona ga uyimu, muni avapela soni vana luhala, na agahagwili gala mulima ukugawona kuvya ndi ungolongondi muni avapelayi soni vana makakala. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Chapanga ahagwili vindu pahi viviveveswa na mulima uwu, na vindu vingali kuvya muni agahalabisa mambu gevikemela kuvya ga chakaka. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Chapanga akitili chenichi kawaka mundu wa kumeka palongolo yaki. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Chapanga ndi mweavawunganisi na Kilisitu Yesu. Chapanga amkitili Kilisitu kuvya luhala witu, kwa njila yaki titepulaniswi na Chapanga, tivya tavandu vetibaguliwi ndava ya Chapanga na kugombolewa. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Hinu ngati Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova, “Mweigana kumeka, ndi, amekelayi ndava ya lihengu la BAMBU.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi ndava ya Yesu Kilisitu kuvambiwa pamsalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Valongo vangu, panabwelili kwinu kuvakokosela mfiyu wa ujumbi wa Chapanga nahengilili lepi malovi geginonopa amala umanya uvaha. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Muni penavi kwinu naamwili nikotoka kumanya chindu chochoha chila nambu kummanya Yesu Kilisitu ndu, yula mweavambiwi pamsalaba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Penavi kwinu navili ngolongondi, na kuvagaya kwa kuyogopa. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Mawuliwu gangu na makokoselu gangu gawusiwi lepi kwa luhala lwa vandu, nambu kwa ulangisu wa makakala ga Mpungu wa Chapanga <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>Nakitili chenicho muni sadika yinu yimuhuvalila makakala ga Chapanga, nambu yihuvalila lepi luhala lwa vandu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala lwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Pamonga nene nikuvakokosela mambu ga luhala kwa vala vevakangili mtima, nambu mambu genago lepi vachilongosi va mulima uwu, veviyagisa makakala gavi. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Tikokosa mfiyu wa luhala lwa chapanga, ndi weufiyiki kwa vandu, ndi Chapanga amali kupanga kwakona kuwumbwa mulima ndava ya ukulu witu. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Kawaka hati chilongosi mmonga wa lusenje lwitu mweamanyili lijambu ili. Ndava muni ngati kuvya vamanyili, ngavamvambii lepi pamsalaba BAMBU mkulu. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Mambu gangalolekana, amala kuyuwanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">mambu gangaholaleka na mundu yoyoha mumtima waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">genago ndi Chapanga avatendelekili vala vevaganili.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Genago ndi mambu Chapanga gatigubukulili kwa njila ya Mpungu waki. Muni Mpungu Msopi ulola mambu goha, hati mambu ga mugati neju ga Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Kawaka mundu mweihotola kumanya maholo ga mundu yungi nambu nga mwene. Mewa kawaka mundu mwihotola kumanya maholo ga Chapanga nambu nga Mpungu wa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Nambu tete tapoki lepi mpungu wa mulima uwu, nambu tapokili mpungu weuhuma kwa Chapanga, ndi muni tihotola kumanya gala Chapanga getipelili waka.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Na tete tijova lepi malovi getiwuliwi kwa luhala lwa vandu, nambu kwa malovi getiwuliwi na Mpungu Msopi, tidandaula mambu ga Mpungu kwa vandu vala vevavi Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Mundu angali Mpungu wa Chapanga ipokela lepi mambu gegihuma kwa Mpungu wa Chapanga. Ndava muni ndi uyimu kwaki, mwene ihotola lepi kumanya ndava genago gimanyikana ndu kwa uhotola wa Mpungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Mundu mweavi na Mpungu wa Chapanga akugamanya mambu goha, nambu kawaka mundu mweihotola kuhamula mambu goha. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Yani mweihotola kumanya luhala lwa BAMBU?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Yani mweihotola kumuwula?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Nambu tete tivii na luhala lwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Vanalihengu va Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Valongo vangu, nanga hotola kulongela na nyenye ngati vandu mwemuvi na Mpungu wa Chapanga. Naganikiwayi kulongela na nyenye ngati vandu va pamulima, ngati vana vadebe muwumi wa Chikilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Yaganikiwayi kuvaliha kwa mavele, lepi kwa chakulya chiyumu, muni mwajitendelekili lepi kupokela. Ndi mbaka hinu mwakona kujitendelekela. <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>Muni nyenye mwakona vandu va pamulima. Wu, lepi chakaka kwakona kuvi na wihu na ngondo pagati yinu? Mambu ago gilangisa njwe kuvya nyenye mwakona vandu va pamulima, mwitama wumi wa chimundu. <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Mmonga winu peijova, “nene ndi mlanda wa Pauli,” Na yungi ijova, “nene ndi mlanda wa Apolo,” Wu, yeniyo yilangisa lepi kuvya mwakona mwitama ngati vandu va mulima uwu?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Hinu, Apolo ndi yani? Na Pauli ndi yani? Tete ndi vatumisi va Chapanga, mwativaletili nyenye sadika. Kila mmonga winu ihenga lihengu leapewili na BAMBU. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Nene namijili mbeyu na Apolo ayitilili manji, nambu Chapanga ndi mweaimelisi. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Mweamijili na mweayitalili manji chindu lepi, Chapanga ndi mwamelisi mbeyu. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Yula mwamijili na mweiyitalili manji voha vamonga, Chapanga yati akumpela njombi kila mundu ndava ya lihengu laki leakitili. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Muni tete ndi vahenga lihengu va Chapanga, na nyenye ndi mgunda waki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Mewawa nyenye ndi lijengu la Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Ndava ya ubwina wa Chapanga nipewili lihengu ili, ngati mundu mweavi na luhala mweijenga, navikili mkingisa mundu yungi ijenga panani yaki. Ndi chabwina kila mundu alola bwina cheijenga. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Kawaka mundu mweihotola kuvika mkingisa panani ya mkingisa wungi, neju ya wula weumali kuvikiwa ndi Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Panani ya mkingisa wenuo mundu ihotola kujenga kwa zahabu, feza amala maganga, ihotola kujenga kwa mikongo, mahamba amala manyahi. <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>Nambu lihengu la kila mundu yati lilolekana ligono Kilisitu peakuyifiyula. Muni ligono lenilo yati wihumila motu, na motu wenuo ndi yati wipima ubwina wa lihengu la kila mundu peavi. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Yikavya cheajengili mundu panani ya mkingisa wenuo chitinyika lepi na motu wenuo, yati ipewa njombi, <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Ngati chajengili yati chitinyika, yati ikosa njombi yaki, nambu mwene yati isanguliwa ngati mundu mwealemili mumotu.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Wu, mumanyi lepi kuvya nyenye ndi Nyumba ya Chapanga, na Mpungu wa Chapanga witama mugati yinu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Hinu, mundu mwaihalabisa Nyumba ya Chapanga ya msopi, Chapanga yati akumuhalabisa mewa, muni Nyumba ya Chapanga, yene ndi nyenye.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Mundu yoyoha akotoka kujikonga, pagati yinu kujilola kuvya avi na luhala wa pamulima, mbanga avyai myimu muni apatayi luhala lwa chakaka. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Muni luhala lwa pamulima ndi uyimu palongolo ya Chapanga. Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, “Chapanga akuvadapa vevavi na luhala mukuchejela kwavi.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>Na Mayandiku gangi gijova, “BAMBU amanyili kuvya maholo ga vevavi na luhala kuvya gangali lihengu.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Hinu, mundu akotoka kuvamekela vandu. Muni kila chindu ndi chinu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>Yikavya Pauli amala Apolo amala Kefa, mulima amala wumi amala lifwa, mambu ga hinu amala gegibwela goha ginu nyenye. <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>Nambu nyenye ndi vandu va Kilisitu, na Kilisitu ndi wa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Vamitumi va Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Mundu atilolayi tete kuvya ngati vatumisi va Kilisitu, vevihengela ujumbi wa mfiyu wa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Chechiganikiwa kwa mundu yoyoha mweapewili lihengu lenili ndi kuvya msadikika. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Kwa nene chindu lepi nikahamuliwa na nyenye, amala na pandu pa kuhamuliwa vandu, nakujihamula namwene. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Mumtima wangu nihamuliwa lepi kwa lijambu loloha, nambu yilangisa lepi kuvya kawaka lawama. BAMBU ndi mweihamula. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Hinu, mkoto kuhamula kwakona lukumbi lwaki, mulekayi mbaka peibwela BAMBU. Mwene yati akugafiyula goha gachitita gegafiyiki, na kuvika pawaka maholo ga mitima ya vandu. Kila mundu yati ipata ulumba kuhuma kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Valongo vangu, nimutumalili Apolo na nene namwene muni kupitila tete mujiwulayi kuhuma kwitu mana ya luhumu ulu. “Mugakamulayi gegayandikwi.” Akotoka kuvya mundu pagati yinu mweimeka na kumvevesa mundu yungi. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Yani mwakuvikili veve kuvya mvaha kuliku vangi? Chapanga lepi ndi mwakupelili vindu vyoha vyeuvi navyu? Ngati, ndava kyani wimeka ngati upewi lepi ngati njombi?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Hinu! Mumali kupewa goha gamwaganayi! Muvi na vindu vyamahele! Muvi vankosi changali tete. Mbanga ngamuvi vachilongosi muni na tete mewa tilongosa pamonga na nyenye. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Niholalela Chapanga atikitili tete vamitumu tivyai vandu va mwishu neju, vetivalangiwi kukomewa palongolo ya vandu, tivikiwi ngati chindu cha kuhekesa, chechilolekana na mulima woha na vamitumi va kunani kwa Chapanga, mewawa na vandu voha. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Tete vayimu ndava ya Kilisitu, nambu nyenye muvi na luhala kwa kuwungana na Kilisitu! Tete tavakata nambu nyenye muvi na makakala. Nyenye vakuvatopesa, nambu tete vakutivevesa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Mbaka hinu, tete tivii na njala na njota, nyula yilalile, titoviwi mavamba, kawaka pandu pakugona. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Kangi ting'ahika na kuhenga lihengu kwa mawoko gitu tavete. Vakatipela likoto tete tikuvamotisa, tikuvayupila kwa Chapanga, vakatinyagayi tikangamala, <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>pevakutiliga, tiyangula kwa upoli. Mbaka hinu vatikitili ngati gahakau wa mulima, kwa kila mundu tete uhakala!<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Niyandika lepi mambu aga ndava ya kuvapela soni, nambu nikuvawula ngati vana vangu vaganu. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Pamonga muvi na valelaji vamahele muwumi winu wa Chikilisitu, nambu muvi lepi dadi vamahele, kwa kuwungana na Kilisitu Yesu nene ndi mwenivi dadi winu mukuvakokosela Lilovi la Bwina nyenye. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Hinu, nikuvayupa neju mulandayi luhumu wangu. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Ndi mana nimtumili Timoti kwinu, mwene ndi mwana vangu mganu na msadikika mukuwungana na BAMBU. Yati akuvakumbusa njila yenilanda muwungana na Kilisitu Yesu. Njila yeniwula pandu pamahele pa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Vandu vangi vatumbwili kumeka na kuholalela ngati nibwela lepi kangi kwinu. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Nambu, yati nibwela kanyata BAMBU akaganayi, penapo ndi yati nikujilolela namwene, lepi chevijova vala vevimeka, nambu mewa kumanya makakala gavi. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Muni Unkosi wa Chapanga lepi kujova ndu, nambu mumakakala. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Hinu, mwigana kyani? Nibwela kwinu na ndonga, amala nibwela na mtima wa uganu na unkozi?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ukemi mu msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Kuvi malovi ga chakaka kuvya pagati yinu kuvi ukemi uhakau, wangahumalila hati pagati ya vandu vangammanya Chapanga. Nijoviwi kuvya mmonga winu itama na mdala wa dadi waki! <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Muhotola wuli kumeka? Ngayivyai mbanga kuyupilisa, na mwenuyo mweikita chindu icho awusiwayi pagati msambi winu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Na nene kwa upandi wangu, kwa higa nivii patali na nyenye, nambu kwa mpungu nivii pamonga na nyenye. Ndi nivii bahapo, nimali kumuhamula mundu yula mweakitili lijambu lenilo la soni. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Pamkonganeka pamonga kwa liina la BAMBU Yesu, nene nivii na nyenye kwa mpungu, hinu kwa makakala ga BAMBU witu Yesu uvi apo, <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>mumgotola mundu uyo kwa Setani muni higa yaki yihalabiswai na mpungu waki usanguliwayi ligono lila la BAMBU.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Kawaka chindu cha kumekela, wu, mmanyi lepi ngemeku lidebe livavisa libulungutu loha la uhembe? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Mujinyambisayi, muni muwusai ngemeku ya kadeni la kumbudila Chapanga, ndi muvyai na libulungutu la mupya langasopewa ngemeku ngati chamwiganikiwa kuvya. Muni Kilisitu awusiwayi luteta ndava yitu ngati mwanalimbelele wa Pasaka. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Ndava yeniyo, tiiselebukila mselebuko wa Pasaka changali kutumila mabumunda gegasopiwi ngemeku, ndi kujova changali kumbudila Chapanga na uhakau, nambu titumila libumunda langali ngemeku ndi kujova ubwina na chakaka.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Navayandikili mubalua yangu mkoto kuhanganilana na vakemi. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Uchakaka ndi kuvya najovili lepi mkoto kuhanganila na vandu voha pamulima nambu vandu vevavi vakemi vanotanu na vadese na vevakumuyupa chimong'omong'o. Muni muvayepa voha venavo yavaganili nyenye kuwuka pamulima uwu nganila! <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Nambu hinu nikuvayandikila kuvya mkoto kuhanganila na mlongo mkilisitu mweavimkemi na mweavi na mnogu uhakau na mnotani na mweiyupa chimong'omong'o na mweiliga na mweigala na mdese na mnyagaji. Mundu ngati mwenuyo hati kulya mkoto kulya nayu.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Hinu, lepi lihengu langu kuvahukukumu vala vevavi kuvala ya msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu. Nambu Chapanga ndi mweakuvahamula. Nyenye muganikiwa kuvahamula vandu vevavi msambi winu? <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Mayandiki Gamsopi gijova, mumvingayi kutali mundu muhakau uyo!<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Malungamiko ga vasadika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Ngati mundu yeyoha pagati yinu avi na luhonda na muyaki msadika, ihotola wuli kumtakila mlongo waki palongola ya vandu vangammanya Chapanga, pahala pa kumtakila palongolo ya vandu va Chapanga? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Wu, mmanyi lepi kuvya vandu va Chapanga yati vakuvahamula vandu va mulima? Ngati mulima yati uhamuliwa na nyenye, ndava kyani muganikiwa lepi kuhamula hati mambu gadebe? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Mmanyi lepi ngati yati mkuvahamula vamitumi va kunani kwa Chapanga? Wu, lepi neju ya mambu ga pamulima! <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Pemwiva na ngondo ngati iyi, ndava kyani muhamba kwa vandu vangali vachilongosi va Nyumba ya Chapanga? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Soni kwinu! Ndi kujova kawaka hati mmonga pagati yinu mweavi na luhala wa kuhotola kuhamula mihalu pagati ya vasadika? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Nambu hinu valongo vasadika vakumtakila myavi palongolo ya libanji la mihalu ya vandu vangasadika vahamula.<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Chakaka kutakilani kwenuku nyenye mwavene kulangisa hotohoto kuvya mwangahotola! Wu, ngayivii chabwina lepi kukongewa! Wu, chabwina lepi kukongewa? Chabwina lepi kwinu kunyagiwa vindu vinu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Nambu, pahala paki, nyenye ndi myiva na kunyaga, kangi ago mukuvakitila valongo vinu! <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Wu, mmanyi lepi kuvya vandu vahakau vipewa lepi Unkosi wa Chapanga? Mkoto kukongewa! Vevikita ukemi, vevigundamila vimong'omong'o, vagosi kugona na vagosi vayavi, na vadala kwa vadala, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>vahiji, vevinota, vevigala, veviheha, vevinyaga, veviliga venavo voha vihanganila lepi muunkosi wa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Vangi vinu mwavi chenicho, nambu hinu mubaguliwi ndava ya Chapanga na kulolekana vabwina palongolo yaki kupitila BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu na kupitila Mpungu wa Chapanga witu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muhengela higa yinu kwa Ukulu wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>Mundu ihotola kujova, “Kwa nene vindu vyoha viganikiwa.” Nambu lepi vindu vyoha vyeviganikiwa. Niyidikila kuvya kila chindu chiganikiwa kwa nene nambu mbwitu kutamiwa na chindu chochoha. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>Mwihotola kujova, “Chakulya chivii ndava ya lileme, na lileme luvi ndava ya chakulya.” Nambu Chapanga yati akuvihalabisa vyoha. Higa ya mundu ndi lepi ukemi ndi kwa kumhengela BAMBU, na BAMBU ndi ndava ya higa. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Chapanga amyukisi BAMBU kuhuma mulifwa na tete mewa yati akutiyukisa kwa makakala gaki.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Wu, mmanyi lepi kuvya higa yinu ndi viwungo vya higa ya Kilisitu? Wu, nitola viungu vya Kilisitu niviwunganisayi na viwungu vya mkemi? Pehe! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Muni, ngati chaumanyili, mwaiwungana na mkemi vivya higa yimonga, ngati chagijova Mayandiku Gamsopi, “Na vavili yati vivya higa yimonga.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Nambu mwajiwungi na BAMBU vivya Mpungu umonga na mwene.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Muleka kukita ugoni. Kumbudila Chapanga kungi kwoha kukitiwa kuvala ya higa nambu mkemi akumbudila chapanga ayikitila higa yaki mwene. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Wu, mmanyi lepi kuvya higa yinu ndi Nyumba ya Mpungu Msopi mweavimugati yinu, ndi mwemwampokili kuhuma kwa Chapanga? Nyenye, vindu vinu lepi mwavene nambu vindu vya Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Mwaguliwi kwa mashonga gamahele. Ndi muyihengelai higa yinu kwa kumlumba Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Lijambu ndava ya kugega mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Hinu tilola mambu gala gamwaniyandili, chabwina mgosi akotoka kugega. <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Nambu ndava ya kuyepa ukemi, ndi kila mgosi avyai na mdala waki mwene, na kila mdala avyai na mgosi waki mwene. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Mgosi amuhengelayi mdala waki chayiganikiwa, na mdala amuhengelayi mgosi waki chayiganikiwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Mdala kawaka uhotola ndava ya higa yaki mwene, nambu avili nawu mgosi waki, mewawa mgosi kawaka uhotola ndava ya higa yaki mwene, nambu mdala waki avili nawu. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Mkoto kunyimana, nambu ngati muyelewini kukita chenicho kwa lukumbi luhupi ndu, ndi mupatayi nafwasi yabwina ya kumuyupa Chapanga. Ndi muwuyilanayi kavili, Setani akotoka kuvalinga ndava muhotola lepi kudivalila mitima hinu.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Malovi aga genikuvajovela malagizu lepi, nambu ndi nivalekekisi muhotola kuhagula. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Chakaka, niganili vandu voha vavyai ngati nene, nambu kila mundu apewili njombi yaki mwene na Chapanga, yungi njombi iyi na yungi yila.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Hinu, kwa vala vangagega na vala valipwela, nikuvajovela kuvya chabwina kuyendelela kutama vene ngati nene. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Nambu ngati mundu ihotola lepi kujidivalila. Chabwina mundu uyo agega kuliku kuvya na mnogo.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Kwa vala vevagegili niwusa mhilu uwu, lepi ya nene ndi kuhuma kwa BAMBU Chapanga. Mdala iganikiwa lepi kulekana na mgosi waki. <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>Ndi ngati alekini nayu, ndi asigalila changali kugegewa, ngati naha lepi, vamtepulanisa na mgosi waki. Na mgosi akotoka kumleka mdala waki.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Kwa vangi, Nijova nene lepi BAMBU Ngati mgosi msadika ana mdala mwangasadiki, na mdala mwenuyo ayidikili kutama nayu, na mgosi mwenuyo akoto kumleka mdala waki. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Na ngati mdala mweisadika ana mgosi mwanga sadika, na mgosi mwenuyo akayidakila kutama nayu, ndi akotoka kumleka mgosi waki. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Muni mgosi mwenuyo mwangasadika iyidikiliwa na Chapanga kwa kuwungana na mdala waki, na mdala uyo mwangasadika iyidikiwa na Chapanga kwa kuwungana na mgosi waki. Ngati ngayikotoka kuvya naha vana vavi ngavavi ngati vana va vandu vangammaya Chapanga, nambu hinu ndi vana va Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Nambu ngati mwangasadika igana kumuleka muyaki mwaisadika, ndi amuleka ndu. Penapo mgosi amala mdala mwaisadika yati ivya hulu. Muni Chapanga avakemili mutama kwa uteke. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Veve mdala mwausadika, umanya wuli ngati kuvya ukumsangula mgosi waku? Amala veve mgosi mwausadika umanya wuli ngati kuvya ukumsangula mdala waku?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vyayi muwumi ngati chawakemeliwi na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Kila mundu ayendelela kutama muwumi weapewili na BAMBU ngati cheatamayi pala peakemeliwi na Chapanga, chenichi ndi chanikuvajovela vandu voha kwa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu woha. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Ngati mundu akemeliwi kuni adumwili jandu, ndi akotoka kukupakisa kuvya adumwili lepi jandu, na ngati pakemeliwi avili akona kudumula jandu, ndi akotoka kudumula. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Muni, kudumula jandu amala changasindimala jandu chindu lepi, chechiganikiwa kuyidakila mihilu ya Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Hinu, kila mundu avyai ngati cheavili peakemeliwi Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Wu, veve wavili wamvanda pewakemeliwi na Chapanga? Koto kuyoma, nambu ngati ukapatayi fwasi ya kuvya waka kita chenicho. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Muni mwene mwakemeliwi na BAMBU kuni avili mvanda, mwenuyo ndi ilekeswa kwa BAMBU. Mewawa mwakemeliwi kuni alekiswi, ndi ivya mvanda wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Voha muguliwi kwa mashonga gamahele, ndi mkoto kuvya vavanda va vandu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Valongo vangu, kila mmonga winu atamayi wumi wulawula ngati cheakemeliwi, muni Chapanga avi pamonga na nyenye.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Likotesi ndava ya vangagega na valipwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Hinu, kugavala gala gemwaniyandikili ndava ya vasongolo vangagega na vasikana vangagegewa kawaka malagizu kuhuma kwa BAMBU, nambu nikuvapela maholo gangu kwa lipyana la BAMBU niganikiwa kusadikiwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Ndi, ndava ya mang'ahiso ga magono aga, hinu chabwina mundu asigalila ngati cheavi. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Wu, ugegili mdala? Hinu koto kulekana na mdala waku. Wakona wangagega? Ndi ukoto kugega. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Nambu ngati ukagegayi ukumbudila lepi Chapanga, kamwali akagegewayi akumbudila lepi Chapanga. Vevigegana yati ving'ahika muwumi wavi, nambu nene nigana ng'ani yikoto kuvakolela nyenye.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Valongo vangu, lukumbi lwalusigalili ndi luhupi: Kutumbula lelu vala vevagegili vatamayi ngati vagegili lepi, <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>Vevivemba vavyai ngati vivemba lepi, veviheka vavyai ngati nakuheka, vevigula vavyai ngati kawaka chindu, <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>vevavi hengela vindu vya mulima uwu vavyai ngati vakuhihengela lepi. Muni mulima uwu uvi papipi kupita.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Nigana nyenye mukoto kuvya na wogohi. Mundu angagega mdala mwene igana kuhenga lihengu la BAMBU muni ilinga kumganisa BAMBU. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Nambu mgosi mweagegili ilola neju mambu ga mulima, kulonda kumganisa mdala waki, <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>ndi akujibagula mwene chihiga na chimpungu. Mdala mwangagegewa ing'ahika na mambu ga BAMBU ndi awusayi higa na mpungu waki kwa BAMBU. Nambu mdala mwagegiwi ing'ahika na mambu ga mulima ndava ya kumganisa mgosi waki.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Nikuvajovela genaga kwa chiyonjokesu chinu, lepi kuvadivalila kwa gala gemugana kuhenga. Nigana muhenga gegiganikiwa, mpata kumuhengela BAMBU kwa mtima woha changali kuhutwa na mambu gangi.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Ngati mundu ilola kuvya akumuhengela lepi chabwina mchumba waki kwa kuhamula kuleka kumugega na lukumbi lupita, kangi mnogu waki nakuuhotola ndi akitayi chaihotola, amugegayi ndu, ivya nakumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Nambu ngati mgosi uyo ahamwili kuhuma mumtima waki changali kung'ang'aniswa kuleka kugega, na ihotola lepi kuyileka minogu yaki, ikita chabwina, kuleka kumgega mdala uyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Mundu mweamwili kugega mdala ikita chabwina, mewa mweangagega mdala ikita chabwina neju.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Mdala mweagegiwi ivya akungiwi na mgosi waki kwa lukumbi lwoha mgosi uyo lwaivya mumi. Nambu ngati mgosi waki afwili, mdala uyo ihotola kugegewa na mundu yoyoha, nambu kwa mgosi mweammanyili BAMBU Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Nambu chenihololela nene, mdala yati ivya na luheku neju ngati isigalila changali kugegewa, niholalela nene mewa nina Mpungu wa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Vyakulya vyaviwusiwi luteta kwa chimong'omong'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Hinu tilolayi vyakulya vyeviwusiwi ndava ya kutetela chimong'omong'o.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Timanyili kuvya, tete tavoha tivii na luhala, nambu luhala ulo gakuvakita vandu vamekayi, nambu uganu ukumjenga. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Ngati mundu iholalela kuvya amanyili chindu, chakaka angamanya chindu chochoha chechikumgana kumanya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Nambu mwammanyili Chapanga mwenuyo amanyikini na Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Ndi, kuvala vyakulya vyevihuwusiwi kwa vimong'omong'o, timanyili kuvya chindu lepi pamulima, timanyili kuvya Chapanga ndi mmonga. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Hati ngati kuna vindu vyamahele vandu vakuvikemela vichapanga pamulima amala kunani kwa Chapanga, na hati ngati kuna vichapanga na vabambu vamahele, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>Kwitu tete avi Chapanga mmonga, Dadi, Muwumba wa vindu vyoha, ndava ya mwene tete tivili. Kangi avili BAMBU mmonga ndu, Yesu Kilisitu, ndi kwa njila yaki vindu vyoha vyawumbiwi, na tete titama ndava ya mwene.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Nambu lepi vandu voha vevamanyili mambu ago. Muni vandu vangi vayovalili kutetela vimong'omong'o, vandu venavo pevilya vyakulya viwona ngati viwusiwi kwa vimong'omong'o. Na muni mitima yavi yilendili vikemewa vahakili. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Nambu chakulya nakutipeleka papipi na Chapanga. Tikalekayi kulya tipungukiwa lepi chindu, tikalyayi nakuyonjokeswa chindu.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Nambu, mujiyangalila uwaka winu ukoto kuvayoka vana sadika yidebe vayingila mukubuda. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Muni mwangakangamala mtima, akakulola veve mweuvi na umanya wilya vyakulya munyumba ya kuyupila vimong'omong'o, wu, na mwene nakulya vyakulya vyeviwusiwi kwa vimong'omong'o? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Hinu, mlongo waku mwenuy mweavi na sadika yangali makakala, yati iyagila kwa ndava ya veve, ndi Kilisitu afwili kwa ndava yaki <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Ngati mvabudisi valongo vinu, na kuvinisa mitima yavi muvya mumbudili Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Hinu, ngati chakulya chikumgwisa mlongo vangu, katu nilya lepi nyama, nikotoka kumgwisa mlongo vangu mukumbudila Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga mitumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Wu, nene lepi na mundu mwanilekekekiswi? Wu, nene namtumi lepi? Wu, nene namuweni lepi Yesu BAMBU witu? Wu, nyenye lepi mwenivapatili ndava ya lihengu langu kwa BAMBU? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Hati ngati vandu vangi vibela kuvya nene mtumi lepi, nambu nyenye muyidikila kuvya nene mtumi, nyenye ndi ulangisu wa nene kuvya mtumu, ndava ya kuwungana kwinu na BAMBU.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Vandu pavakunitakila nikujikengelela naha, <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>ndi, tiganikiwa lepi kupokela chakulya na mnyweso ndava ya lihengu langu? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Wu, tete nakuganikiwa kuvya mulugendu na vadala vitu vasadika, ngati chevikita vamitumi vangi, valongo va BAMBU, na mewa Kefa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Amala nene ndu na Banaba ndi mwatiganikiwa kupewa njombi yitu kwa kukita lihengu? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Wu, manjolinjoli yoki mwailipila lihengu laki kwa ihenga? Wu, mlimaji yoki mwangalya matunda ga mgunda waki wa mzabibu? Wu, mdimaji yoki mwanganywa mavele ga mifuya yaki?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Wu, nijova mambu aga chimundu? Wu, malagizu nakujova mewawa naha? <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Yiyandikwi Mumalagizu ga Musa, “Koto kuyikunga ng'ombi mlomo payibena nganu.” Wu, ndi tijovayi Chapanga ihengela ng'ombi? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Wu, Chapanga ijova lepi genaga neju ndava yitu? Genaga gayandikiwi ndava yitu, mundu peilima na yula mwaibena, voha vavili viganikiwa kuhenga lihengu lenilo kwa kuhuvalila kupata pahala pa mabenu. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Yikavya tete tapandili mbeyu ya chimpungu pagati yinu, wu, yati livya lijambu livaha tikapatayi chiyonjokesu kuhuma kwinu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Yikavya vandu vangi viganikiwa kupata vindu kuhuma kwinu, wu, tete tiganikiwa lepi kuliku venavo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Nambu tete tahuvalili lepi haki yeniyo. Pahala paki, tisindamili kila chindu muni tikotoka kulibelelela Lilovi la Bwina la Kilisitu na kuvakokosela vandu. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Wu, mmanyi lepi kuvya vevihenga Munyumba ya Chapanga vipewa chakulya chavi Munyumba ya Chapanga, na vevivika pa lusanja lwa luteta vipewa pahala pavi pa lusanja lwa luteta lwenulo. <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Mewawa BAMBU alagizi, vevikokosa Lilovi la Bwina vapewa chakulya chavi mulihengu lenilo.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Nambu, nahengili lepi hati chindu chimonga chechiganikiwa. Na niyandika lepi aga kwa huvalila ya mukunihengela mambu ago, kwa nene mbanga kufwa kuliku mundu yoyoha awonayi kuvya nikujilumbalila waka. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Nene nimeka lepi ndava ya kukokosa Lilovi la Bwina, lenili ndi lihengu lenilagizwi kulihenga. Hinu nijiyangalila ngati nikokokosa lepi Lilovi la Bwina! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Nganihagwili lihengu lenili kwa kugana kwangu, nganiholalili kupewa luhuna, nambu muni nikita ndava ya lihengu lanipewili. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Luhuna lwangu ndi chindu choki? Hinu luhuna lwangu ndi kukokosa Lilovi la Bwina waka. Changali kudayi vindu vyeniganikiwa kwa kukokosa Lilovi la Bwina.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Nene mvanda lepi wa mundu yoyoha, nijikitili mvanda wa vandu voha muni nimpelayi Kilisitu vandu vamahele. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Kwa Vayawudi natamili ngati Myawudi muni nivapatayi Vayawudi vamsadika Yesu, pamonga nene nivii pahi ya malagizu ga Musa, ndi nivapatayi vevavili pahi ya malagizu. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Na kwa vala vevavi kutali na malagizu ga Musa, nitama ngati vene, muni niyva ngati vene vevavi kuvala ya malagizu. Lepi kujova nivili kuvala na malagizu ga Chapanga, muni nihinyiwi na malagizu ga Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Penavi vangolongondi navili ngati vene muni nivapatayi vangolongondi. Nakitili kila chindu kwa vandu voha muni nivasangulayi pagati yavi mukila njila.<verse eid="1CO 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Nikita aga goha kwa ndava ya Lilovi la Bwina, nipatayi mota zaki. <verse eid="1CO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Wu, mmanyili lepi paluvanja lwa mikinu, pamonga na vevijumba voha vijumba, ndi mmonga ndu mwaitola njombi, hinu na nyenye mjumbayi namuna yiyoyo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Vevijumba vikita mazowezi na adabu, vikita chenicho muni vapewa njingwa yangahalabika! Nambu tete tikita naha tipatayi njingwa yangahalabika. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Ndi, chanijumba ndi nigana kuhotola, ndi chanikomana, lepi mtovanaji ngati mundu mweitova pawaka. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Nambu nikuying'aha higa yangu muni nihotola kutalalila muni penimali kuvakokosela vangi, nene mwene nikotoka kubelelewa.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuvakalila ndava ya chimong'omong'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Valongo vangu, nigana mmanyai kuvya vagogo vitu vavili mulugendu kuni vilongoswa na lihundi, na voha vakupwiki bwina munyanja yidung'u. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Voha vabatiziwi mulihundi lila na munyanja yila muni vawungayi na Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Voha valili chakulya chilachila cha mpungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>Voha vanywili unywelelu wulawula wa chimpungu, muni vanywili manji kuhuma muliganga la Chimpungu lelavi mulugendu pamonga nawu, litalau lelilo lavi Kilisitu mwene. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Nambu vamahele neju vamganisi lepi Chapanga ndi vafwili na higa zavi zadandasiki kulugangatu.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Mambu genago ndi luhumu kwitu, lwelukutilangisa tikotoka kunogela mambu gahakau ngati chevanogili vene. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Mukoto kuyupa chimong'omong'o ngati chevakitili yavi, ngati Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova, “Vandu vatamili kulya na kunywa, vakayima na kukita mambu ga ukemi.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Mewa tikotoka kukita ugoni ngati vangi vavi, vakafwa ligono limonga vandu elufu ishilini na zidatu. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Tikotoka kumlinga Kilisitu ngati vene chevakitili vangi vavi, vakomiwi na liyoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Mkoto kuvembeneka ngati chavavembenike vangi vavi mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga mweileta lifwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Hinu, mambu genago gavakolili vene gavyai luhumu kwa vangi, na gayandikiwi muni kutihakalila tete vetitama lukumbi ulu lwa mwishu.<verse eid="1CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Mwakujiwona ayimili chakukangamala ajiyangalila akotoka kugwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Kulingiwa kwekuvakolili ndi kudebe kwa vandu. Chapanga msadikika, nakutilinga kupita makakala ginu, pamonga na kulingiwa, mwene yati akuvapela makakala ga kukangamala na njila ya kuhuma mwenumo.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Hinu, vankozi vangu, muyepayi kuyupa chimong'omong'o. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Nilongela na nyenye, vandu mwemuvi na luhala, muamula mwavene genijova aga. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Chikombi chetihengela pachakulya cha BAMBU. Ndi chetimsengusa Chapanga, petihenga kunywelela tiwungana na ngasi ya Kilisitu? Mewa petimetula libumunda tiwungana na higa ya Kilisitu? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Ndava kuvi na libumunda limonga, pamonga tete tivii tavamahele, ndi higa yimonga, muni tavoha tilya libumunda lenilo.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Mlolayi luhumu lwa vandu va Isilaeli, vevilya luteta viwungana pamonga na lusanja lwa luteta lwenulo. <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Hinu nijova kyani? Chakulya amala chimong'omong'o chechiwusiwi luteta kwa chivii na mana yoyoha? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Lepi! Luteta lwa lweluwusiwa na vandu vangammanya Chapanga vakumuwusila mzuka, lepi Chapanga. Katu mbwitu nyenye muwunganayi na mzuka. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Mwihotola lepi kunywa chikombi cha BAMBU mewa chikombi cha mizuka, mwihotola lepi kulya pameza ya BAMBU mewa pameza ya mizuka. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Wu, tigana kumkita BAMBU avyai na wihu? Tiholalela kuvya tivii na makakala kuliku mwene?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>Vindu vyoha viyidakiliwa, nambu lepi vyoha vyabwina. Vindu vyoha viyidikilwa nambu lepi vyoha vijenga sadika. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Mundu akotoka kulonda chiyonjokesu yaki mwene, nambu chiyonjokesu cha muyaki.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Mlyai chindu chochoha chila chechiguliswa pandu paki changali kukota kota ndava ya mtima winu weukuvalangisa gabwina na gahakau. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, “Mulima na vyoha vyevivii mugati yaki ndi vya BAMBU.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Ngati mundu nakuvya msadika akavagongolela kulya chakulya myidikilayi kuhamba, mlyayi vyoha vyeakuvatekela changali kukota ndava ya mtima waeukuvalangisa gabwina na gahakau. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Nambu mundu akavajovelayi, “Chakulya chenichi chiwusiwi kwa chimong'omong'o,” Ndi mkoto kulya ndava ya mwenuyo mwavajovili. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Nijova, “Ndava ya mtima weukuvalangisa gabwina na gahakau.” Lepi Ndava ya mtima weukuvalangisa gabwina na gahakau, ndava ya mtima weukuvalangisa gabwina na gahakau ga mwenuyo mwavajovili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">“Yati mnikota ndava kyani uwaka wangu uhamuliwayi mtima weulangisa gabwina na gahakau? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Yikavya nene nilya chakulya na kumsengusa Chapanga, ndava ya kyani nilaumiwayi kwa chakulya chenicho, kwa ndava nilya kwa kumsengusa Chapanga?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Hinu, chochoha chemwikita kulya amala kunywa, mkita goha kwa Ukulu wa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Hinu mlolayi, mkoto kuvayomesa Vayawudi amala vandu vangali Vayawudi amala kwa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Muvyai ngati nene, nilinga kuvaganisa voha kwa njila yoyoha, changali kulonda chiyonjokesu changu namwene nambu nikuvalondela chiyonjokesu vangi voha, muni vasanguliwayi.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Muniyiga nene ngati chemukumuyiga Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lijambu la kugubika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Nikuvalumba nyenye kwa kunikumbuka na ndava ya kugakamula malagizu ganavapelili. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Nambu nigana mmanyayi kuvya Kilisitu ndi mutu wa kila mgosi, na mgosi ndi mutu wa mdala waki, na Chapanga ndi mutu wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Hinu ndi mgosi yoyoha mweakumuyupa Chapanga amala kukokosa ujumbi wa Chapanga kuni agubiki mutu waki, mwenuyo akuhuvevesa mutu waki ndi Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Na mdala ngati akumuyupa Chapanga amala kukokosa ujumbi wa Chapanga changagubika mutu waki, mdala mwenuyo ndi akumvevesa mgosi waki ndi mutu waki, mdala mweikita chenicho ndi iwanangana ngati mdala mwaketili mayunju pamutu waki. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Mdala mwangagubika mutu waki, ndi mbanga aketayi mayunju gaki. Nambu ngati soni kwa mdala kuketa zoha amala nganila mayunju gaki, ndi mbanga agubika mutu waki. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Mgosi iganikiwa lepi kugubika mutu waki, ndava mwene ndi luhumu na ukulu wa Chapanga, nambu mdala ndi chilolilo cha ukulu wa mgosi. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Mgosi awumbi lepi kuhuma kwa mdala, nambu mdala awumbiwi kuhuma kwa mgosi. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Mgosi awumbiwi lepi ndava ya mdala, nambu mdala awumbiwi ndava ya mgosi. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Ndava yeniyo na ndava ya vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga. Mdala agubika mutu waki, uvya ulangisu kulangisa uhotola weuvi panani yaki. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Hati ago, palongolo ya BAMBU mdala chindu lepi changali mgosi, na mgosi chindu lepi changali mdala voha vihuvalilana. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Ngati mdala cheawumbiwi kuhuma kwa mgosi, mewawa mgosi ivelekewa na mdala. Nambu vindu vyoha vihuma kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Mwavene muhukumwa, wu, chabwina mdala kumuyupa Chapanga changagubika chindu kumutu? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Hati vandu chevawumbiwi yilangisa kuvya mgosi kuvya na mayunju gatali ndi soni kwaki mwene, <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>nambu kwa mdala kuvya na mayunju gatali ndi utopesa kwaki, apewi mayunju gatali muni gamgubikayi. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Nambu mundu igana undindani ndava ya lijambu ili, amanyayi kuvya tete tivii lepi na mvelu wungi wa undindani, mewawa mumsambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu kawaka mivelu yingi.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Libumunda la kumkumbuka BAMBU</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matei 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maluko 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Peniyendelela kuvapela malagizu aga, nihotola lepi kuvalumba hati padebe, mikonganeku yinu nyenye mwihenga mambu gamahele gahakau kuliku gabwina. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Pakutumbula, niyuwini ngati pemwikonganeka pamonga ngati msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu mwipechengana. Nene nisadika padebe, <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>changali mtahu yiganikiwa pavya ulekenganu pagati yinu, muni kulangisa vala veviyidakiliwa na Chapanga vamanyikayi hotohoto. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Chakaka mwikonganeka, mwihololela mwilya chakulya cha kumkumbuka lifwa la BAMBU, nambu lepi! <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Muni pamwilya kila mmonga winu ilya chakulya, hati yihumila vangi vilya Changali kuvalindila vayavi ndi yihumila vangi vavi na njala, na vangi vagalili! <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Wu, mwihotola lepi kulya na kunywa kunyumba yinu? Amala mukuyivevesa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va Chapanga na kuvavevesa vandu avo vangali chindu? Nivakokosela kyani? Nivalumba? Lepi! Lepi kuvala lijambu ili.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Muni nene napokili mawuliwu kuhuma kwa BAMBU genavalekili, kuvya kilu yila BAMBU Yesu peagotoliwi kwa makoko vaki, atolili libumunda, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>akamsengusa Chapanga, akalimetula, akajova. “Yeniyi ndi higa yangu yeyiwusiwa ndava yinu, mkita aga kwa kunikumbuka nene.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Mewawa, pamali kulya, akatola chikombi, akajova. “Chenichi ndi chikombi cha lilaganu lamupya lelikitwa livya na makakala kwa ngasi yangu. Mkita naha kila pemwinywa, kwa kunikumbuka nene.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Kila lukumbi pemwilya libumunda lenili na kunywa chikombi ichi, mukokosa lifwa la BAMBU, mbaka peibwela. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Ndava yeniyo, mundu yeyoha mweilya libumunda na kunywa chikombi cha BAMBU changali kuganikiwa, yati ivya na lijambu ndava ya ngasi ya BAMBU <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Yikumgana mundu yoyoha ajilolayi mwene hoti, kangi alyayi libumunda lenilo na anywela chikombi chenicho. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Muni mundu yeyoha mweilya na kunywa changali kumanya mana ya higa ya BAMBU, akujiletela uhamula waki mwene. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Ndi mana vamahele pagati yinu vatamu, na vangi vafwili. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Ngati tijilolili tavete bwina ngati tibuniwi lepi na Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Nambu patihamuliwa na BAMBU, tiwuliwa, tikotoka kuhengewa uhamula pamonga na vandu va mulima.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Hinu, valongo vangu, pamkonganeka pamonga kulya libumunda la kumkumbuka BAMBU, kila mundu amlindilayi muyaki. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Na ngati kuvi na mundu mweavi na njala, alyayi hoti kunyumba yaki. Muni kukonganeka kwinu kukoto kuleta uhamula. Nambu, kuvala mambu gangi, yati nikuvajovela penibwela.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Njombi za Mpungu Msopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Valongo, nigana mmanya kuvala njombi ya Mpungu Msopi, nigana nyenye mmanya bwina mambu aga. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Mmanyili kuvya kwakona mungasanguka, mwatalaliwi na kuyagiswa kwa kuyupa vimong'omong'o ndu. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Hinu, mmanya kuvya kawaka mundu mweihotola kujova, “Yesu apewi likoto!” Kuni ilongoswa na Mpungu wa Chapanga. Mewawa kawaka mundu mweihotola kujova, “Yesu ndi BAMBU,” Changalongoswa na Mpungu Msopi.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Njombi za mpungu zivii zamahele, nambu Mpungu mweiwusa njombi yeniyo ndi mmonga. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Zivii njila zamahele za kumhengela, nambu BAMBU mweihengewa ndi mmonga. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Gavi mahengu ndalindali ga kukita, nambu Chapanga mmonga ndi mweihotolesa mahengu goha kwa vandu voha. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Kila mundu ipewa ugubukulo na Mpungu kwa chiyonjokesu chavoha. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Hinu, mundu mmonga ipewa na Mpungu Msopi uhotola wa kujova ujumbi wa umanyi, na yungi ipewa ujumbi wa luhala cheigana Mpungu Msopi yuyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Mpungu yuyoyo akumpela yungi sadika, na yungi akumpela njombi ya kulamisa vandu. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Mpungu Msopi akumpela yungi uhotola wa kukita chinamtiti, na yungi uhotola wa kukokosa ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga, yungi uhotola wa kumanya mpungu uhakau na mpungu wabwina, yungi ipewa uhotola wa kujova luga ya chiyehe na yungi uhotola wa kudandaula luga yeniyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Genago goha ndi mahengu ga Mpungu Msopi yuyo mmonga, ndi mwakumpela uhotola kila mmonga, ngati cheigana mwene.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Viwungu vyamahele, nambu higa yimonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Ngati chayivii higa yimonga yeyivii viwungu vyamahele, na viwungu vyenivyo vyoha vikita higa yimonga, ndi chayivii mewawa kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Muni, tete, tikavyai Vayawudi amala Vandu vangali Vayawudi, vavanda amala vangavya vavanda, tavoha tibatiziwi kwa Mpungu mmonga muhiga yiyoyo yimonga, na tavoha vatinywili Mpungu yuyo mmonga.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Higa lepi chiwungu chimonga ndu, nambu viwungu vyamahele. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Ngati chigendelu ngachijijovili, “Ndava muni nene nachiwoko lepi, hinu nene lepi pandu pahiga,” Ndi ngaulekili kuvya pandu pa higa. <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Ngati likutu ngalijijoveli, “Ndava nene lepi lihu, hinu nene lepi pandu pa higa,” Ndi ngaulekili lepi likutu ilo kuvya pandu pa higa. <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Ngati higa yoha ngayivya lihu, likutu ngalivii koki? Na ngati higa yoha ngayivya likutu, mundu ngaihotola wuli kunuha? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Nambu hinu Chapanga avipangili viwungu vyenivyo kila chimonga pandu paki ngati cheaganili. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Ngati vyoha gavivii chiwungu chimonga, higa ngayivii lepi! <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Uchakaka ndi uwu, pandu pa higa ndi pamahele, nambu higa ndi yimonga.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Hinu, lihu lihotola lepi kuchijovela chiwoko, “Nikuganili lepi veve,” Mewawa mutu nakuhotola kugajovela magendelu, “Nivaganili lepi nyenye.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Nambu neju ya ago, yilolekana kuvya pandu pa higa pepilolekana kuvya ngolongondi, ndi vyeviganikiwa neju. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Kangi, viwungu vyetiholalela kuvya vyangatopeswa neju, ndi vyatikuvivika bwina. Na viwungu vyevileta soni palongolo ya vandu, ndi vivikiwa bwina neju. <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>Nambu viwungu vyeviyidakiliwa kulolekana kwa vandu chigana lepi kugubikwa. Chapanga mwene ayivikili higa mumpangu na kuchipela utopesa chiwungu chila chechipungukiwi utopesa, <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>muni vyoha vikoto kulekengana muhiga, nambu viwungu vyoha vitangatilana. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Ngati chiwungu chimonga chikalemala ndi viwungu vyoha vilemala pamonga nachu. Chiwungu chimonga chikalumbiwayi ndi viwungu vingi vyoha viheka pamonga nachu.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Hinu, mwavoha nyenye ndi higa ya Kilisitu, kila mmonga winu ndi chiwungu cha higa yeniyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Chapanga avikili mu msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu, avikili hoti mitumi kangi valota va Chapanga na vawula, kangi avikili vala vanauhotola wa kukita chinamtiti, vanauhotola wa kulamisa na kutangatila, vevihotola kuyimalila mahengu na vevihotola kujova luga za chiyehe. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Voha lepi vamitumi, valota va Chapanga amala vawula. Lepi voha vavi lepi na uhotola wa kukita chinamtiti. <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Lepi voha vevihotola kulamisa vatamu amala kujova luga ya mupya amala kudandaula luga ya chiyehe. <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Hinu ndi, mukangamala neju kunogela njombi yivaha yamahele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Na nene yati nikuvalangisa njila yabwina neju kuliku zoha.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Uganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Hati ngati nikalongelayi kwa chiluga za vandu na hati ya vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga, nambu ngati nivii lepi na uganu nene nivii ndu ngati lwami lwa lidebe amala njeketu. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Hati ngati, nihotola kukokosa ujumbi wa Chapanga, hati ngati nimanya mfiyu woha wa umanya wa vindu vyoha, hati ngati nivii na sadika hati kuhotola kuwusa hitumbi, nambu ngati nivii lepi na uganu chindu lepi. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Nikawusayi vindu vyangu vyoha na kuvapela vangangu, na kangi nikauwusa higa yangu iyochwayi, ngati kawaka uganu yikunitangatila lepi chindu.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Mweavi na uganu isindimala na ivya mbwina, ivya na uganu ivya lepi na wihu, imeka lepi. <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Mundu mweavi na uganu ivya na utopesa, ilonda lepi chiyonjokesu chaki mwene, ivya lepi na ligoga, ikumbuka lepi gahakau. <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Mundu mweavi na uganu ihekelela lepi uhakau, nambu ihekelela uchakaka. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Mundu mweavi na uganu itotokela lepi magono goha isindimala na isadika na ihuvalila.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Uganu wangali mwishu. Ngati kuvi na hipanji vya kukokosa Ujumbi wa Chapanga, ndi yati viyaga ligono limonga, ngati chipanji cha kujova luga ya chiyehe yati yiyaga, ngati kuvi umanya yene yati yipita. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Kujiwula kwitu na kumanya vindu lepi kutimili mewawa kujova kwitu ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga kutimili lepi. <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>Nambu chila chechikamiliki pechibwela, vyoha vyangakamilika yati viwuka.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Panavili namwana kang'enya najovayi chimwana, namanyili chimwana, naholalili chimwana. Nambu hinu, muni namvaha, mambu gachiwana nigalekili. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Chetilola hinu ngati pamihu pepatitili muchilolilo, nambu mwanakandahi yati tilolana mihu kwa mihu. Hinu nimanyili padebe ndu, nambu mwanakandahi yati nimanya chitimilifu, ngati Chapanga cheanimanyili nene nganila.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Hinu gasindimali mambu aga gadatu, sadika, huvalila na uganu neju ya goha ndi uganu.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Mkangamala kuvya na uganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Mukangamala kuvya na uganu. Mewawa mkangamala kupata hipanji hingi vya chimpungu, neju chipanji cha kujova ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Mundu mweijova kwa luga ya chiyehe ijova lepi na vandu, nambu ilongela na Chapanga, mwene ijova kwa makakala ga Mpungu Msopi mambu gegafiyiki. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Nambu yula mweijova kwa ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga akuvajenga vandu, kwa kuvakangamalisa mitima na kuvapolesa mitima vandu. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Mwailongela luga ya chiyehe akujijenga mwene. Nambu mweijova ujumbi kuhuma kwa vandu akuujenga msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Hinu nigana mwavoha nyenye mujovai kwa luga ya chiyehe nambu niganili neju muvyai na uhotola wa kujova Ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga, ikita chabwina neju kuliku yula mundu yula mweijova luga ya chiyehe, mbaka avyaa mundu mweihotola kudandaula mambu ago gegijoviwa, ndi msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu yijengewa. <verse eid="1CO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Hinu valongo vangu, ngati nibwela kwinu na kulongela na nyenye kwa luga ya chiyehe yikuvaganisa kyani? Nakuvaganisa chindu chochoha, nambu ngati nikavadandaulila ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga amala mawuliwu nunuyu.<verse eid="1CO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Ndi chayivii kwa vindu vyangali kuvya na wumi nambu vyaviwusa lwami ngati chitolilo amala kanjeke, wu, mundu ihotola wuli kumanya lunyimbu lwelukinwa ngati vindu vyenivyo viwusa lwami hotohoto pevitoviwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Kangi lipenenga likavembayi changali kulanda uyovalelu yaki, ndi linjolinjoli yoki mweakujitendekeha kwa ngondo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Mewawa na nyenye, ngati lulimi lwinu lujova lepi chindu changamanyikana yani mweihotola kumanya gemwijova? Malovi ginu yati giyaga pawaka. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Zivii luga zamahele pamulima na kawaka hati yimonga yangali mana. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Nambu yikavya nene nakumanya chailongela mundu yungi, nene myehe kwaki mewa mundu mwenuyo mewa ndi myehe kwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Mewawa vandu nyenye, mwinogela kupewa njombi ya Mpungu, mkangamalayi kupata njombi za Mpungu Msopi muni kutangatila kujenga msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Hinu, mweilongela luga ya chiyehe ayupayi apatayi uhotola wa kuvadandaulila vandu gala geajovili. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Penilongela kwa luga ya chiyehe mpungu wangu ndi weukumuyupa Chapanga, nambu luhala lwangu nakuhengeka. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Hinu nikita kyani? Yati nikumuyupa Chapanga kwa mpungu wangu, yati nimuyupa chapanga kangi kwa luhala, yati niyimba kwa mpungu wangu, mewa yati niyimba kangi kwa luhala lwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Ukamsengusa Chapanga kwa mpungu waku, ihotola wuli mundu mwangali sadika mweavimngonganu kuyidikila luyupu lwaku lwa kusengusa kwa kujova “Ena,” Ngati nakumanya chewijova? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Hati ngati wihotola kumuyupa Chapanga chakaka kuvya kwa bwina, nambu kwa yungi kawaka chiyonjokesu.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Nikumsengusa Chapanga kuvya nene nilongela kwa luga ya chiyehe kuliku mwavoha nyenye. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Nambu mungonganu wa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu nigana kujova malovi mhanu gegimanyikana ndi nivawulayi vangi, kuliku kujova malovi gamahele neju ga luga ya chiyehe.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Valongo vangu, mkoto kuhololeala ngati vana vadebe. Kuuvala uhakau, muvyai ngati vana vadebe, nambu pemwiholalela muvyai ngati vandu vavaha. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova. “BAMBU ijova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">‘Yati nilongela na vandu kwa luga ya chiyehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">yati nijova kwa milomo ya vayehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">yati nijova kwa vandu ava,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">pamonga na ago vandu avo, vakuniyuwanila lepi.’ ”<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Hinu ndi, njombi ya kujova luga ya chiyehe ndi ulangisu, lepi ndava ya vandu vevisadika. Nambu kwa vala vangasadika, nambu njombi ya kujova ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga ndi ndava ya vala vevisadiki ndi lepi ndava ya vangasadika.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Hinu, ngati msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu voha vakakonganeka pamonga, na voha vakatumbula kujova kwa luga za chiyehe, ngati vabwelili vangamanya na vandu vangali sadika, wu, yati vijova lepi kuvya nyenye mwipenga? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Nambu, voha ngati mwijova ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga, akabwela mundu mwangasadika, goha geiyuwana yati gakumlangisa uhakau waki mwene, na goha geiyuwana yati gemuhamula. <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>Gegafiyiki mumtima waki yati gihumbuliwa, mwene yati akumfugamila na kumuyupa Chapanga ijova, “Chakaka Chapanga avi pamonga na nyenye apa!”<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpangiliu kwa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Valongo vangu hinu nijova kyani? Pemwikonganeka pamonga kumuyupa Chapanga, mmonga ayimba lunyimbu na yungi awulayi na yungi avyai na ugubukulilu kuhuma kwa Chapanga na yungi avyai na luga ya chiyehe na yungi adandawulayi gegijovewa. Goha gavyai ndava ya kujenga msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Ngati mundu yoyo ijova kwa luga ya chiyehe, hinu vajovayi vandu vavili amala vadatu, ndi vajova mmonga mmonga, na avyayi mundu wa kudandaula geijova. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Nambu ngati kawaka mundu mwihotola kudandaula chila chechijoviwi mu msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu, nambu mwaijova luga ya chiyehe aguna pamngonganu, ndi ajovai na mtima waki mwene na Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Kuvala vala vevavi na chipanji kujova ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga, vajova vavili amala vadatu, na vangi vagalinga malovi ago. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Yikavya mundu mmonga peijova na yungi mweiyuwanila akapewayi ugubukulilu kuhuma kwa Chapanga, ndi yula mweatumbwili kujova aguna. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Muni mwavoha mwihotola kukokosa ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga, mmonga mmonga, muni mwavoha mujiwula na kukungamaliswa mtima. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Njombi ya kukokosa ujumbi wa Chapanga ndi yiganikiwa utalaliwayi na yula mweavi na chipanji chenicho. <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Muni Chapanga lepi wa ngondo nambu ndi wa uteke.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Ngati cheyivili mvelu pamngonganu wa vandu va Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>Vadala viganikiwa kutama nuu mumsambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu, pevikonganeka vene viyidakiliwa lepi kujova. Nambu viganikiwa kuyidakila ngati chegijova malagizu ga Vayawudi. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Ngati vavi na makotesi ga kukota vavakotayi vagosi vavi kunyumba, muni soni kwa mdala kujova mungonganu wa msambi vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Wu, muholalela Lilovi la Chapanga lihumili kwinu nyenye amala livabwelili nyenye ndu? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Ngati mundu yoyoha iholalela kuvya mwene ndi mjumbi wa Chapanga amala avi na chipanji cha Mpungu Msopi, amanya aga genikuvayandikila nyenye ndi malagizu ga BAMBU. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Nambu ngati mundu nakumanya genago, ndi, mundu akotoka kumtangatila mundu mwenuyo.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Hinu ndi, valongo vangu mganikiwa kuvya na mnogo neju wa kujova ujumbi wa Chapanga, nambu mkoto kumbesa mundu kujova kwa luga ya chiyehe. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Nambu mwavoha mkitayi kwa utopesa na kwa kulanda uyovelu.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Uyukiswa wa Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Hinu, valongo, nigana kuvakumbusa lila Lilovi la Bwina lenivakokosili, na nyenye mukayipokili na kuyima cha kukangamala mugati yaki. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Kwa njila yaki msanguliwi, ngati mukamula malovi genivakokosili. Manya ngati mwasadiki waka.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Nene navapelili mambu ga mana neju genapokili namwene: Kuvya Kilisitu afwili ndava ya kubuda kwitu ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>avikiwi mulitinda, akayuka ligono la datu ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi, <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>amuhumalili Petili, na kangi avahumalili vamitumi kumi na vavili vala. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Kangi avahumalili valongo neju ya miya mhanu kwa pamonga wa valanda, vamahele vakona wumi, nambu vangi vafwili. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Lukumbi lungi amuhumalili Yakobo na mewa avahumalili vamitumi voha.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Pamwishu anihumalili nene, nene mwenavi ngati mundu mwavelekiwi lepi kwa lukumbi lwaki. <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Muni nene mdebe neju pagati ya mitumi, na niganikiwa lepi kukemelewa mtumi, muni naying'aisi msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vavi vandu va Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Nambu kwa ubwina wa Chapanga, nivii ngati chanivii, kwa ubwina wa Chapanga kwangu wavi lepi waka. Lepi kuvya nihengili lihengu kwa kukangamala kuliku voha, lepi nene nambu ubwina wa Chapanga weuhenga lihengu na nene. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Nambu hati naha, yivyai vene ndi vevikokosa amala nene ndi mwenikokosa na chenichi ndi chetikokosa na nyenye ndi chemwisadika.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uyukiswa witu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Yikavya tikokosa kuvya Kilisitu ayukiswi kuhuma mulifwa, ndava kyani pagati yinu mwijova kuvya kawaka uyukiswa wa vevafwili? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Ngati kawaka uyukiswa wa vevafwili, hinu na mwene Kilisitu ayukili lepi, <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>na ngati Kilisitu ayukili lepi, makokoselu gitu gangamanyikana na sadika yinu yangali chindu. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Neju pa genago tete ngativii tijova udese palongolo ya Chapanga, muni tajovili kuvya Chapanga amuyukisi Kilisitu kuhuma mulifwa, nambu amuyukisi lepi, ngati ndi chakaka vevafwili viyukiswa lepi, ndi Kilisitu yukiswa. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Muni ngati chakaka vevafwili nakuyukiswa, ndi na Kilisitu ayukili lepi. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Ngati Kilisitu ayukili lepi, ndi sadika yinu ya waka, mwakona muyendelela kumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Neju ya genago, vala voha vevafwili kuni vakumsadika Kilisitu vayagili. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Ngati huvalila yitu mu Kilisitu na yivala wumi uwu wa hinu, hinu tete vandu kuhengewa lipyana kuliku vandu voha pamulima.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Nambu uchakaka ndi uwu, kuvya Kilisitu ayukili kuhuma mulifwa ndi kulangisa kuvya voha vevafwili yati viyukiswa. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Muni, lifwa labwelili na mundu mmonga, na mewa na uyukiswa kuhuma vafwili ubwelili na mundu mmonga. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Ngati vandu kuwungana na Adamu vandu voha vifwa, mewawa voha yati viyukiswa kwa kuwungana na Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Nambu kila mundu na Lukumbi lwaki, Kilisitu mtumbula wa uyukiso, kangi vevavi vaki ndi pala peibwela. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Pa genago, mwishu yati uhika lukumbi Kilisitu yati akumgotolela Dadi Chapanga Unkosi, peiwusa kutali kila mpungu wa ulongosi na mpungu wa uhotola na makakala. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Muni Kilisitu iganikiwa alongosayi mbaka Chapanga pakuvagwisa makoko vaki na kuvavika pahi ya magendelu gaku. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Likoko la mwishu kuyongomeswa ndi lifwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Muni, Mayandiku gijova, “Chapanga avikili vindu vyoha pahi ya magendelu gaki.” Nambu Mayandiku Gamsopi pegijova, “Vindu vyoha vivikiwi pahi ya magendelu gaki avitalalilayi.” Ndi Chakaka Chapanga nakuyingila mulilundu lenilo la vindu, muni mwene ndi akuvivika pahi ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Nambu vindu vyoha pevivikwa pahi ya ulongosi wa Kilisitu, na Mwana mwene yati akujivika pahi ya Chapanga, mwavikili goha pahi ya ulongosi waki, ndi Chapanga alongosa panani ya goha.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Ngati kawaka kuyukiswa, wu, vandu vala vevibatiziwa ndava ya vevafwili vahuvalila kupewa kyani? Ngati vevafwili viyukiswa lepi, ndava kyani kubatiziwa ndava ya vene? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Na kwa upandi ndava kyani tikujiyoka kila lukumbi? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Valongo, nene nikulilola lifwa lukumbi lwoha! Ulumba wenivii nawu ndi kuwungana Kilisitu Yesu BAMBU witu mwakunikita nikokosa lijambu ili. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Ngati lilengu langu ngalivyai la chimundu, kula kukomana kwangu na vandu vevavili ngati hinyama hikali apa pa Efeso ngakuvili chindu choki? Ngati vevafwili nakuyuka ndi, “Tilya na kunywa, muni chilau yati tifwa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Mkoto kukongeka. “Vankozi vahakau vihalabisa uyovelu wa mundu.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Muyimuka! Mutumbula kutama bwina, na muleka kumbudila Chapanga. Vangi pagati yinu vammanyili lepi Chapanga. Nikuvajovela soni yivaha kwinu!<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Higa ya uyukiswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Pangi mundu yati ikota, “Vevafwili yati viyukiswa wuli? Yati vivya na higa yoki?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Genago ndi makotelu ga uhomela! Ukamija mbeyu, changali kufwa hoti yivya nakumela. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Chaumija ndi mbeyu yene, pangi nganu amala mabenu gangi, nambu lepi lumelelu lwoha ubwela kumela mwanakandahi. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Chapanga akuyipela higa yeayiganili mwene mbeyu yeniyo, kila mbeyu yipewa higa yaki ya mwene.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Higa ya viwumbi vyoha ziwanangana lepi. Vandu vana higa yavi na hinyama hina higa yavi na videge vina higa yavi na somba zina higa zavi.<verse eid="1CO 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Yivili higa ya kunani kwa Chapanga na ya pamulima, ubwina wa higa ya kunani kwa Chapanga ndi wungi, na ubwina wa higa ya pamulima ndi wungi. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Lilanga lina ubwina waki, na mwehi na ndondo, hati ndondo yina ubwina waki hilekengana kwa ubwina.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Ndi chayivili kuvavala kuyukiswa kwa vevafwili. Ndi ngati mbeyu, higa yizikwa pahi uvya chakuwola, nambu uyukiswa changali kuwola. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Higa yizikwa cha soni, uyukiswa cha ukulu, kuzikwa namuna ya kulenda, uyukiswa uyva kwa makakala. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Tizikwa kwa muhiga yativelekewa nayu, pauyukiswa ndi higa ya chimpungu. Yivili higa ya magono goha na higa chimpungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, “Mundu wa kutumbula, Adamu avili mundu mwana wumi,” Nambu Adamu wa mwishu ndi Mpungu mwakuvapela vandu wumi. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Nambu nakulongolela higa ya chimpungu, nambu ndi wula wa wetivelekiwi nawu, ndi kangi wula wa chimpungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Adamu wa kutumbula kuwumbwa kuhuma muludaka lwa pamulima, ahumili pahi paludaka, Adamu pili ahumili kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Vandu voha vevavili va pamulima vavili ngati mundu mwawumbiwi kuhuma muludaka, nambu vandu vala vevavili va kunani kwa Chapanga vavili ngati yula mwahumili kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Ngati chetiwanangini na yula mwawumbiwi kwa ludaka, mewawa yati tiwanangana na mwenuyo mwahumili kunani kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Hinu, valongo, nijova naha, chila chechakitiwi kwa higa na ngasi nakuhotola kuyingila mu Unkosi wa Chapanga, na higa yeyiwola nakuhotola kuyingila pandu pa higa yangawola.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Muyuwanila, nikuvajovela gamfiyu aga, tete yati tifwa lepi, nambu tete tavoha yati ting'anambuswa, <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>Mambu aga yati gihumila lukumbi lwa lipenenga la mwishu pelipyuliwa. Chigafula kukupila na kulola. Muni lipenenga peyipyula, vevafwili yati viyukiswa vakotoka kufwa kavili na tete yati ting'anamuswa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Muni higa iyi yakahalibika ndi yiganikiwa ying'anamuka changahalibika, higa yayihotola kufwa yikoto kufwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Hinu, higa iyi yeyifwa ying'anamuka nakuvya payivya nakuwola, na chechifwa pachivya nakufwa, penapo ndi palitimilika lilovi lelayandikwi, “Lifwa likomiwi, uhotoleka ukatimiliki!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>“Lifwa, kuhotola kwaku kuvili koki? Lifwa makakala gaku ga kuleta mvinisu uvi koki?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Lifwa lipewa makakala ga kuvinisa kuhuma mukumbudila chapanga, mewawa kubuda kupata makakala mu malagizu. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Nambu timsengusa Chapanga mwakutipela uhotola kwa njila ya BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Hinu, valongo vangu vaganu, muyima chakukangamala na changanyugusika. Magono goha muyendelela kujiwusa mulihengu la BAMBU, ndava mmanya kuvya lihengu lemwihenga kwa BAMBU liyaga lepi waka.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvatangatila vandu va Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Hinu nijova kuvala mashonga ga kuvatangatila vandu va Chapanga: Ndi misambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va Galatia. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Kila dominika, kila mmonga winu avikayi mashonga kuwanangana na mabenu gaki, ndi kukoto kuvya liholo na kuyupa utangatila wa mashonga lukumbi lwa nibwela. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Penibwela kwinu, yati nikuvatuma vala venikuvahagula pagati yinu nivapela balua ya umanyiso muni vapeleka njombi zinu ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Ngati yikaganikiwayi kuhamba na nene, ndi, yati vihamba pamonga na nene.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mipangu ya Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Penihamba Makedoni yati nibwela hoti kwinu muni nigana kuhamba Makedonia. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Pangi yati nitama kwinu kwa lukumbi nunuyu, amala yati nitama pamonga na nyenye lukumbi lwoha lwa mbepu, muni munitangatila kuhamba mulugendu lwangu kokoha kwenihamba. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Nigana lepi kupita kwinu kanyata na kuyendelela na lugendu lwangu. Nihuvalila kutama kwinu kwa lukumbi nunuyu BAMBU akaganayi.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Yati nitama pa Efeso mbaka ligono la Pentekoste, <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>mlyangu uvaha uvi waka kwa ndava ya lihengu langu la uchakaka apa, pamonga vevakunibela navene vamahele.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Timoti akabwela, mlolayi akotoka kuvya na wogoyi peivya pamonga pagati yinu, muni ihenga lihengu la BAMBU ngati nene. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Hinu mundu yoyoha akotoka kumvevesa, nambu amtangatila ayendelela na lugendu lwaki kwa uteke ndi ahotola kuwuya kwa nene, muni nene pamonga na valongo vitu tikumlindila.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Nilongela kumvala mlongo witu Apolo: Nimuyupa neju abwela kwinu pamonga na valongo vangi, nambu aganili lepi kubwela hinu nambu yati ibwela peipata fwasi.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jambusa ya mwishu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Mvya mihu, mukangamala musadika yinu kuyima, muvya vakekesi na vemuvi na makakala. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Kila chamwihenga muhenga kwa uganu.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Valongo, muvamanyili valongo va Stefani, vene ndi vandu va kutumbula kupokela sadika ya Chiklisitu ku Akaya, na vajihumisi kuvatendekela vandu va Chapanga. Nikuvayupa neju Valongo vangu, <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>mlanda uchilongosi wa vandu ngati avo, na uchilongosi wa kila mundu akita lihengu na kuhengeka pamonga nawu.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Niheka neju kuvya Stefani na Fotunatusi, na Akaiko vahikili, vanitangatili kuhenga lihengu lukumbi nyenye muvi lepi. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Vausangalwisi mpungu wangu mewa ngati chevavasangalwisi nyenye. Hinu yiganikiwa kuvakumbuka vandu ngati avo.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Misambi yoha ya vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Asia zikuvajambusa. Akula na Plisika pamonga na msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vevikonganeke munyumba yavi vakuvajambusa neju mukuwungana na BAMBU. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Valongo voha vevavi apa vakuvajambusa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Mewawa na nyenye mjambusanayi kulangisa uganu wa Chikilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Nene Pauli, niyandika jambusa zenizi kwa chiwoko changu namwene.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Mundu yoyoha mwangamgana BAMBU avi na likoto. Ee BAMBU, Bwela!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Ubwina wa BAMBU Yesu uvya na nyenye.<verse eid="1CO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Nikuvagana nyenye voha mukuwungana na Kilisitu Yesu Ena.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
